# Windows 11 29H1 Sounds Directory
# Placeholder for custom 29H1 system sounds

# This directory should contain:
# - 29h1-system-default.wav (Default system sound)
# - 29h1-system-exclamation.wav (Exclamation sound)
# - 29h1-system-hand.wav (Hand sound)
# - 29h1-system-asterisk.wav (Asterisk sound)
# - 29h1-system-question.wav (Question sound)
# - 29h1-notification-default.wav (Notification sound)
# - 29h1-notification-im.wav (IM notification)
# - 29h1-notification-mail.wav (Mail notification)
# - 29h1-notification-proximity.wav (Proximity notification)
# - 29h1-notification-reminder.wav (Reminder notification)
# - 29h1-logon.wav (Logon sound)
# - 29h1-logoff.wav (Logoff sound)
# - 29h1-startup.wav (Startup sound)
# - 29h1-shutdown.wav (Shutdown sound)

# All sounds should be in .wav format, 16-bit, 44.1kHz stereo
# Keep file sizes under 1MB for system performance
